window.NODES=[{"code": [], "depth": 0, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["overview"], "node": ".", "type": "root", "contents": {"overview": "# Forkly\n\nForkly is a food delivery marketplace: customers order from local restaurants, couriers deliver, and Forkly takes a commission on each order.\n\n## Users\n\n- Customers order food on the mobile app or the website.\n- Restaurants manage their menu and accept orders in the partner dashboard.\n- Couriers pick up and deliver orders using the courier app.\n- The ops team handles refunds, promotions and courier issues in the ops console.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Browsing and searching restaurants, ordering, paying by card.\n- Delivery by Forkly couriers, with live tracking.\n- Weekly payouts to restaurants.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- Restaurants' own delivery staff.\n- Cash payments.\n- Grocery and non-food retail.\n\n## Constraints\n\n- Card data never touches Forkly servers outside the payments service (PCI scope).\n- Customer data is stored in the EU.\n"}}, {"code": [], "depth": 1, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["overview"], "node": "experience", "type": "experience", "contents": {"overview": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/courier-mobile/src/shell/"], "depth": 2, "derives_from": ["experience/design-system"], "documents": ["shell"], "node": "experience/courier-app", "type": "surface", "contents": {"shell": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/courier-mobile/src/screens/delivery-run/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/delivery/live-tracking", "system/services/dispatch", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/courier-app/delivery-run", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/courier-mobile/src/screens/job-offer/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/delivery/courier-assignment", "system/services/dispatch", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/courier-app/job-offer", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/courier-mobile/src/screens/shift/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/delivery/courier-assignment", "product/account/sign-in", "system/services/dispatch", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/courier-app/shift", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/customer-mobile/src/shell/"], "depth": 2, "derives_from": ["experience/design-system"], "documents": ["shell"], "node": "experience/customer-app", "type": "surface", "contents": {"shell": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/customer-mobile/src/screens/account/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/account/sign-in", "product/account/ratings", "system/services/customer-bff", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/customer-app/account", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/customer-mobile/src/screens/cart-and-checkout/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/ordering/cart", "product/ordering/checkout", "product/ordering/promo-codes", "product/ordering/scheduled-orders", "system/services/customer-bff", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/customer-app/cart-and-checkout", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": "# States\n\n## States\n\n| State | When | What the user sees |\n|---|---|---|\n| Editing | Basket has items | Items, total, Pay button. |\n| Paying | Pay tapped, waiting for the API | Spinner on the Pay button; basket locked. |\n| Verifying | Payment needs 3-D Secure | The bank's page in a sheet. |\n| Placed | Order placed | Confirmation with estimated delivery time. |\n| Declined | Payment declined | Message and card picker; basket kept. |\n| Closed | Restaurant closed during payment | Message; no charge; link back to restaurant list. |\n\n## Transitions\n\n| From | Event | To |\n|---|---|---|\n| Editing | tap Pay | Paying |\n| Paying | placeOrder returns PLACED | Placed |\n| Paying | placeOrder returns REQUIRES_ACTION | Verifying |\n| Paying | placeOrder returns DECLINED | Declined |\n| Paying | placeOrder returns RESTAURANT_CLOSED | Closed |\n| Verifying | bank check completes | Placed |\n| Declined | choose another card | Editing |\n"}}, {"code": ["apps/customer-mobile/src/screens/home-feed/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/discovery/browse", "product/discovery/restaurant-page", "system/services/customer-bff", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/customer-app/home-feed", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/customer-mobile/src/screens/order-tracking/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/delivery/live-tracking", "product/support/refunds", "system/services/customer-bff", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/customer-app/order-tracking", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/customer-mobile/src/screens/search/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/discovery/search", "system/services/customer-bff", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/customer-app/search", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/customer-web/src/shell/"], "depth": 2, "derives_from": ["experience/design-system"], "documents": ["shell"], "node": "experience/customer-web", "type": "surface", "contents": {"shell": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/customer-web/src/screens/account/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/account/sign-in", "product/account/ratings", "system/services/customer-bff", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/customer-web/account", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/customer-web/src/screens/cart-and-checkout/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/ordering/cart", "product/ordering/checkout", "product/ordering/promo-codes", "product/ordering/scheduled-orders", "system/services/customer-bff", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/customer-web/cart-and-checkout", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/customer-web/src/screens/home/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/discovery/browse", "product/discovery/restaurant-page", "system/services/customer-bff", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/customer-web/home", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/customer-web/src/screens/order-tracking/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/delivery/live-tracking", "system/services/customer-bff", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/customer-web/order-tracking", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/customer-web/src/screens/search/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/discovery/search", "system/services/customer-bff", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/customer-web/search", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["packages/ui/"], "depth": 2, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["foundations", "components"], "node": "experience/design-system", "type": "design-system", "contents": {"foundations": "", "components": ""}}, {"code": ["packages/messaging/"], "depth": 2, "derives_from": ["product/ordering/promo-codes", "product/delivery/live-tracking", "product/delivery/courier-assignment", "product/partner/order-acceptance", "product/account/sign-in", "product/support/refunds"], "documents": ["templates"], "node": "experience/messaging", "type": "messaging", "contents": {"templates": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/ops-console/src/shell/"], "depth": 2, "derives_from": ["experience/design-system"], "documents": ["shell"], "node": "experience/ops-console", "type": "surface", "contents": {"shell": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/ops-console/src/screens/couriers/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/delivery/courier-assignment", "system/services/dispatch", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/ops-console/couriers", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/ops-console/src/screens/orders/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/partner/order-acceptance", "system/services/orders", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/ops-console/orders", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/ops-console/src/screens/payouts/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/partner/payouts", "system/services/payments", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/ops-console/payouts", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/ops-console/src/screens/promos/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/ordering/promo-codes", "system/services/pricing", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/ops-console/promos", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/ops-console/src/screens/refunds/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/support/refunds/rules.md#refund-window", "system/services/payments", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/ops-console/refunds", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/ops-console/src/screens/sign-in/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/account/sign-in", "system/services/identity", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/ops-console/sign-in", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/partner-dashboard/src/shell/"], "depth": 2, "derives_from": ["experience/design-system"], "documents": ["shell"], "node": "experience/partner-dashboard", "type": "surface", "contents": {"shell": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/partner-dashboard/src/screens/finance/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/partner/payouts", "system/services/partner-bff", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/partner-dashboard/finance", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/partner-dashboard/src/screens/live-orders/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/partner/order-acceptance", "product/ordering/scheduled-orders", "system/services/partner-bff", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/partner-dashboard/live-orders", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/partner-dashboard/src/screens/menu-editor/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/partner/menu-management", "system/services/partner-bff", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/partner-dashboard/menu-editor", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/partner-dashboard/src/screens/reviews/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/account/ratings", "system/services/partner-bff", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/partner-dashboard/reviews", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": ["apps/partner-dashboard/src/screens/sign-in/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/account/sign-in", "system/services/partner-bff", "experience/design-system"], "documents": ["design", "states"], "node": "experience/partner-dashboard/sign-in", "type": "screen", "contents": {"design": "", "states": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 1, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["overview"], "node": "product", "type": "product", "contents": {"overview": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 2, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["overview"], "node": "product/account", "type": "product-area", "contents": {"overview": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 3, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["user-story"], "node": "product/account/ratings", "type": "feature", "contents": {"user-story": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 3, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["user-story"], "node": "product/account/sign-in", "type": "feature", "contents": {"user-story": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 2, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["overview"], "node": "product/delivery", "type": "product-area", "contents": {"overview": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 3, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["user-story"], "node": "product/delivery/courier-assignment", "type": "feature", "contents": {"user-story": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 3, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["user-story"], "node": "product/delivery/live-tracking", "type": "feature", "contents": {"user-story": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 2, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["overview"], "node": "product/discovery", "type": "product-area", "contents": {"overview": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 3, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["user-story"], "node": "product/discovery/browse", "type": "feature", "contents": {"user-story": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 3, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["user-story"], "node": "product/discovery/restaurant-page", "type": "feature", "contents": {"user-story": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 3, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["user-story"], "node": "product/discovery/search", "type": "feature", "contents": {"user-story": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 2, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["terms"], "node": "product/glossary", "type": "glossary", "contents": {"terms": "# Glossary\n\n## Terms\n\n| Term | Meaning | Not to confuse with |\n|---|---|---|\n| Basket | Items a customer has picked from one restaurant before paying. | Order |\n| Order | A paid request for food from one restaurant, delivered to one address. | Basket |\n| Payout | Money Forkly transfers to a restaurant for its delivered orders, minus commission. | Refund |\n| Refund | Money returned to a customer for an order or part of it. | Payout |\n| Courier shift | A period in which a courier is available to accept jobs. | \u2014 |\n"}}, {"code": [], "depth": 2, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["overview"], "node": "product/ordering", "type": "product-area", "contents": {"overview": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 3, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["user-story"], "node": "product/ordering/cart", "type": "feature", "contents": {"user-story": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/glossary"], "documents": ["user-story", "rules"], "node": "product/ordering/checkout", "type": "feature", "contents": {"user-story": "# Checkout\n\n## Story\n\nAs a customer, I want to pay for my basket in one step, so that my food is on its way without extra screens.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Given a valid basket and a saved card, when I tap Pay, then the order is placed and I see the estimated delivery time.\n- Given the restaurant closed while I was paying, when I tap Pay, then no money is taken and I am told the restaurant is closed.\n- Given my bank asks for 3-D Secure, when I complete it, then the order is placed as if no check had been needed.\n- Given the payment is declined, when I tap Pay, then the basket is kept and I can choose another card.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- Splitting a bill between several people.\n- Paying with cash.\n", "rules": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/glossary"], "documents": ["user-story", "rules"], "node": "product/ordering/promo-codes", "type": "feature", "contents": {"user-story": "", "rules": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/glossary"], "documents": ["user-story", "rules"], "node": "product/ordering/scheduled-orders", "type": "feature", "contents": {"user-story": "", "rules": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 2, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["overview"], "node": "product/partner", "type": "product-area", "contents": {"overview": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 3, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["user-story"], "node": "product/partner/menu-management", "type": "feature", "contents": {"user-story": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 3, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["user-story"], "node": "product/partner/order-acceptance", "type": "feature", "contents": {"user-story": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/glossary"], "documents": ["user-story", "rules"], "node": "product/partner/payouts", "type": "feature", "contents": {"user-story": "", "rules": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 2, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["overview"], "node": "product/support", "type": "product-area", "contents": {"overview": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/glossary"], "documents": ["user-story", "rules"], "node": "product/support/refunds", "type": "feature", "contents": {"user-story": "", "rules": "# Refund rules\n\n## Refund window\n\n- A refund can be requested up to 14 days after delivery. Example: an order delivered on 1 March can be refunded until 15 March.\n\n## Payout\n\n- A refund is paid to the original payment method. Example: an order paid by card is refunded to that card.\n"}}, {"code": [], "depth": 1, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["overview"], "node": "system", "type": "system", "contents": {"overview": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 2, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["context-map", "conventions", "decisions"], "node": "system/architecture", "type": "architecture", "contents": {"context-map": "", "conventions": "", "decisions": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 2, "derives_from": ["product/glossary"], "documents": ["entities", "lifecycle"], "node": "system/domain-model", "type": "domain-model", "contents": {"entities": "", "lifecycle": "# Lifecycles\n\n## Order\n\n### States\n\n| State | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| PENDING | Created, payment not yet authorised. |\n| PLACED | Payment authorised; waiting for the restaurant. |\n| ACCEPTED | Restaurant is preparing the food. |\n| ASSIGNED | A courier has taken the job. |\n| PICKED_UP | The courier has the food. |\n| DELIVERED | Handed to the customer; payment captured. |\n| CANCELLED | Stopped before delivery; authorisation released. |\n| FAILED | Payment was declined. |\n\n### Transitions\n\n| From | Event | To |\n|---|---|---|\n| PENDING | payment authorised | PLACED |\n| PENDING | payment declined | FAILED |\n| PLACED | restaurant accepts | ACCEPTED |\n| PLACED | no acceptance within 5 minutes | CANCELLED |\n| ACCEPTED | courier accepts job | ASSIGNED |\n| ASSIGNED | courier picks up | PICKED_UP |\n| PICKED_UP | courier confirms delivery | DELIVERED |\n"}}, {"code": ["infra/"], "depth": 2, "derives_from": ["system/architecture"], "documents": ["infra"], "node": "system/platform", "type": "platform", "contents": {"infra": ""}}, {"code": [], "depth": 2, "derives_from": [], "documents": ["overview"], "node": "system/services", "type": "services", "contents": {"overview": ""}}, {"code": ["services/catalog/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/discovery/browse", "product/discovery/search", "product/discovery/restaurant-page", "product/ordering/cart", "product/ordering/checkout", "product/ordering/scheduled-orders", "product/partner/menu-management", "system/domain-model", "system/architecture"], "documents": ["api", "logic", "storage", "events"], "node": "system/services/catalog", "type": "service", "contents": {"api": "", "logic": "", "storage": "", "events": ""}}, {"code": ["services/customer-bff/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/discovery/browse", "product/discovery/search", "product/discovery/restaurant-page", "product/ordering/cart", "product/ordering/checkout", "product/ordering/promo-codes", "product/ordering/scheduled-orders", "product/delivery/live-tracking", "product/account/sign-in", "product/account/ratings", "product/support/refunds", "system/domain-model", "system/architecture"], "documents": ["api", "logic"], "node": "system/services/customer-bff", "type": "service", "contents": {"api": "", "logic": ""}}, {"code": ["services/dispatch/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/discovery/browse", "product/ordering/scheduled-orders", "product/delivery/live-tracking", "product/delivery/courier-assignment", "product/partner/order-acceptance", "system/domain-model", "system/architecture"], "documents": ["api", "logic", "storage", "events"], "node": "system/services/dispatch", "type": "service", "contents": {"api": "", "logic": "", "storage": "", "events": ""}}, {"code": ["services/identity/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/ordering/checkout", "product/account/sign-in", "system/domain-model", "system/architecture"], "documents": ["api", "logic", "storage"], "node": "system/services/identity", "type": "service", "contents": {"api": "", "logic": "", "storage": ""}}, {"code": ["services/notifications/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/ordering/promo-codes", "product/delivery/live-tracking", "product/delivery/courier-assignment", "product/partner/order-acceptance", "product/account/sign-in", "product/support/refunds", "system/domain-model", "system/architecture"], "documents": ["api", "logic"], "node": "system/services/notifications", "type": "service", "contents": {"api": "", "logic": ""}}, {"code": ["services/orders/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/ordering/cart", "product/ordering/checkout", "product/ordering/scheduled-orders", "product/delivery/live-tracking", "product/partner/order-acceptance", "product/account/ratings", "product/support/refunds", "system/domain-model", "system/architecture"], "documents": ["api", "logic", "storage", "events"], "node": "system/services/orders", "type": "service", "contents": {"api": "", "logic": "", "storage": "", "events": ""}}, {"code": ["services/partner-bff/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/ordering/scheduled-orders", "product/partner/menu-management", "product/partner/order-acceptance", "product/partner/payouts", "product/account/sign-in", "product/account/ratings", "system/domain-model", "system/architecture"], "documents": ["api", "logic"], "node": "system/services/partner-bff", "type": "service", "contents": {"api": "", "logic": ""}}, {"code": ["services/payments/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/ordering/checkout", "product/partner/payouts", "product/support/refunds", "system/domain-model", "system/architecture"], "documents": ["api", "logic", "storage", "events", "compliance"], "node": "system/services/payments", "type": "service", "contents": {"api": "# Payments API\n\nREST over HTTPS, base path `/payments/v1`. Called only by other services, with service-to-service tokens; apps never call it directly.\n\n## POST /authorizations\n\nReserves the order total on the customer's card. Called by orders when an order is placed.\n\n### Request\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| orderId | uuid | yes | Order being paid; also the idempotency key. |\n| amount | money | yes | Total from pricing. Payments never recalculates it. |\n| paymentMethodId | string | yes | Saved card token from the payment provider. |\n\n### Response\n\n| Field | Type | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| authorizationId | uuid | Id to capture or release later. |\n| status | enum | AUTHORIZED, REQUIRES_ACTION or DECLINED. |\n| actionUrl | url | 3-D Secure page when status is REQUIRES_ACTION. |\n\n### Errors\n\n| Status | Code | When |\n|---|---|---|\n| 409 | already_authorized | An authorisation already exists for this order with a different amount. |\n| 422 | invalid_payment_method | The card token is unknown or expired. |\n\n## POST /authorizations/{id}/capture\n\nTakes the reserved money. Called by orders when the order is delivered.\n\n### Response\n\n| Field | Type | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| captureId | uuid | Id of the captured payment. |\n| capturedAmount | money | Amount taken; never more than authorised. |\n\n### Errors\n\n| Status | Code | When |\n|---|---|---|\n| 404 | not_found | No authorisation with this id. |\n| 409 | not_capturable | The authorisation was released or already captured. |\n", "logic": "", "storage": "", "events": "", "compliance": ""}}, {"code": ["services/pricing/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/discovery/restaurant-page", "product/ordering/cart", "product/ordering/checkout", "product/ordering/promo-codes", "system/domain-model", "system/architecture"], "documents": ["api", "logic", "storage"], "node": "system/services/pricing", "type": "service", "contents": {"api": "", "logic": "", "storage": ""}}, {"code": ["services/ratings/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/discovery/restaurant-page", "product/account/ratings", "system/domain-model", "system/architecture"], "documents": ["api", "logic", "storage"], "node": "system/services/ratings", "type": "service", "contents": {"api": "", "logic": "", "storage": ""}}, {"code": ["services/search/"], "depth": 3, "derives_from": ["product/discovery/browse", "product/discovery/search", "product/partner/menu-management", "system/domain-model", "system/architecture"], "documents": ["api", "logic", "storage"], "node": "system/services/search", "type": "service", "contents": {"api": "", "logic": "", "storage": ""}}];